    "body": "Starship doesn't overwrite the prompt variable for every prompt draw anymore, thus other prompts might overwrite the starship prompt after upgrading.\r\nohmyzsh is likely enabling another prompt theme. IIIRC the command for disabling this is `prompt off`. Please try putting this before the starship init and after the ohmyzsh init.\r\n\r\nPlease reopen this issue if this doesn't fix your issue.",
